WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.601
Months passed.

2
00:00:11.602 --> 00:00:19.633
Rabbit was happy in his new home.

3
00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:34.771
He was clever at finding the sweetest grass.

4
00:00:34.772 --> 00:00:43.673
He learned how to hide from hawks.

5
00:00:43.674 --> 00:00:46.943
On rainy days the rabbits stayed inside.

6
00:00:46.944 --> 00:00:50.859
That's when Rabbit thought about Henry and the toys.

7
00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.064
"I wonder how everyone is doing," Rabbit thought.

8
00:00:55.065 --> 00:01:01.954
Sometimes he even missed Robot!

9
00:01:01.955 --> 00:01:12.480
One day the rabbits heard a sound.

10
00:01:12.481 --> 00:01:17.775
"It's the big metal monster again!" the spotted rabbit said.

11
00:01:17.776 --> 00:01:22.256
"It's called an RV," Rabbit said wisely.

12
00:01:22.257 --> 00:01:41.455
"It's fun to ride in an RV!"

13
00:01:41.456 --> 00:01:45.555
The rabbits approached the RV.

14
00:01:45.556 --> 00:01:49.916
Some people stepped out.

15
00:01:49.917 --> 00:01:58.383
Rabbit hopped with joy. "It's Henry and his parents!"

16
00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:01.624
Henry saw a rabbit hopping nearby.

17
00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:05.420
"Hey, Mom and Dad!" he said. "Look!"

18
00:02:05.421 --> 00:02:07.674
Henry pointed to the rabbit.

19
00:02:07.675 --> 00:02:12.385
"It looks just like my old velveteen rabbit!"

20
00:02:12.386 --> 00:02:15.522
Mom nodded. "It does.

21
00:02:15.523 --> 00:02:18.589
I wonder what happened to Rabbit."

22
00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:22.425
"Me too," Henry said.

23
00:02:22.426 --> 00:02:29.068
Henry and Rabbit stared at each other for a while.

24
00:02:29.069 --> 00:02:32.434
Rabbit hopped closer.

25
00:02:32.435 --> 00:02:35.325
Henry reached down to pet him.

26
00:02:35.326 --> 00:02:39.613
"Rabbit was a good friend," Henry said softly.

27
00:02:39.614 --> 00:02:42.662
"I'll never forget him."

28
00:02:42.663 --> 00:02:48.113
Then Henry got up. "Good-bye, Rabbit."

29
00:02:48.114 --> 00:02:52.010
Rabbit watched Henry and his parents walk away.

30
00:02:52.011 --> 00:02:55.402
He thought of all their happy times together.

31
00:02:55.403 --> 00:02:58.295
"Thank you, Henry," he thought.

32
00:02:58.296 --> 00:03:10.905
"Your love made me real."

